WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/system/components/CommandConfirmDialog.tsx — a PROP-DRIVEN presentational confirm dialog
  the VehicleCommandCenter raises before a dangerous command. Hook: useTranslation ONLY (no data fetch).
    <Modal open size="sm" class="bg-gray-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl border border-red-500/20">
      <div onKeyDown={Esc->onClose, Enter->onConfirm if canConfirm && !loading}>
        <header> <AlertTriangle in red rounded chip/> <h2> t(def.labelKey, def.labelFallback) </h2> </header>
        <p> t(def.confirmKey ?? '', def.confirmFallback ?? 'Are you sure?') </p>
        {confirmInput && <>
            <p> t('commands.confirm.typeToConfirm', {word: confirmInput}) </p>
            <Input ref autofocus value=inputValue onChange/>
        </>}
        <footer>
          <Button variant=ghost onClick=onClose> t('common.cancel','Cancel') </Button>
          <Button variant=danger loading={loading} disabled={!canConfirm} onClick=onConfirm>
            { remaining>0 ? `${t('common.confirm')} (${remaining}s)` : t('common.confirm') } </Button>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </Modal>
  Props: open, onClose, onConfirm, def: CommandDef, loading?.
  Internal state: a countdown remainder (def.countdown ?? 0; setInterval prev<=1?0:prev-1) and the confirm-input text.
  canConfirm = remaining===0 && (!confirmInput || inputValue.trim().toUpperCase() === confirmInput.toUpperCase()).
  On open: reset remaining=countdown, clear input, focus the input after 50ms.

REQUIRED-STATE MAPPING (honest — the web component is presentational + prop-driven; no fabricated fetch)
  loading  → submission .submitting (web `loading`)           : Confirm shows spinner, controls lock.
  error    → submission .failed                                : inline failure banner + Retry (native enrichment).
  stale    → connection .stale (ADR-013)                       : warning freshness chip + data-age advisory.
  offline  → connection .offline (ADR-013)                     : muted chip + wake advisory.
  empty    → an unrenderable def (empty labelKey + fallback)   : friendly empty state, never a blank box.
  + the web source's own branches: countdown-locked / awaiting-input / ready / typed-match.
  The submission + freshness envelope is DELIVERED through the shared P1/S8 `CommandConfirmSource` seam
  (the command-dispatch status + the vehicle live-state) — the same contract the sibling CommandSearch uses —
  NOT fetched by the view.

